# Derived from the style the existing sources already use, so that the one-time
# reformat stays small: 4 spaces, K&R braces, 100 columns as in .editorconfig.
# Nothing is formatted by this file yet; the pre-commit hook that enforces it is
# skipped until the reformat has landed. See lefthook.yml.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
TabWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
ColumnLimit: 100
BreakBeforeBraces: Linux
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: None
AlignConsecutiveMacros: Consecutive
IndentCaseLabels: true
PointerAlignment: Right
SortIncludes: Never
